    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "#Project Management Chatbot\r\n\r\nUse this chatbot to help you understand what’s expected in each milestone and plan your next steps.\r\nYou can ask questions about deadlines, deliverables, and how to organize your work. The AI can also help you break large tasks into smaller ones and suggest what to focus on next.\r\n\r\n:::details [<i class=\"fa fa-briefcase\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Possible Stems**]\r\n* Help me understand what I should be doing in Milestone 1.\r\n\r\n- How can I stay organized while working on my interactive app?\r\n\r\n- Here’s what I’ve done so far — what should I prioritize next?\r\n\r\n- Can you explain what ‘conditional logic’ means in this project?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
